{"ID":"20240205165631-u3uhmcx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205165631-u3uhmcx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165631-u3uhmcx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206084650-j6kc694\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206084656-42dxgb2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206084650-j6kc694\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"红芪","type":"doc","updated":"20240902145308"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206084704-l5ash6u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084704-l5ash6u","updated":"20240206084707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产甘肃等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈圆柱形，少有分枝，上端略粗，长1050cm，直径0.62cm。表面灰红棕色，有纵皱纹、横长皮孔及少数支根痕，外皮易脱落，剥落处淡黄色。质硬而韧，不易折断，断面纤维性，并显粉性，皮部黄白色，木部淡黄棕色，射线放射状，形成层环浅棕色。气微，味微甜，嚼之有豆腥味。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t补气固表，利尿托毒，排脓，敛疮生肌。用于气虚乏力，食少便溏，中气下陷，久泻脱肛，便血崩漏，表虚自汗，气虚水肿，痈疽难溃，血虚萎黄，内热消渴，慢性肾炎蛋白尿，糖尿病。"}]},{"ID":"20240206084656-42dxgb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206084656-42dxgb2","updated":"20240206084656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206084656-iya00pz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722162613-8nya3p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722162613-8nya3p9","updated":"20240722162658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 1-20240722162613-i06hz4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 2-20240722162657-d5t6ivw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722162758-o17369o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722162758-o17369o","updated":"20240722165530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 358px;","style":"width: 348px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 5-20240722165530-zbhjxrp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 348px;\" parent-style=\"width: 358px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 827px;","style":"width: 817px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 3-20240722162758-uuq2akn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 817px;\" parent-style=\"width: 827px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722162509-v4vz4u6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722162509-v4vz4u6","updated":"20240806160231"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 365px;","style":"width: 355px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 6-20240722165626-0k3nd9e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 355px;\" parent-style=\"width: 365px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 7-20240722165715-iamw4d1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 9-20240722170053-ham0mfv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722165809-optqiey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722165809-optqiey","updated":"20240722170127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 386px;","style":"width: 376px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 8-20240722170005-7j41o3m.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 376px;\" parent-style=\"width: 386px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 384px;","style":"width: 374px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪 4-20240722162841-qsfy0hz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 374px;\" parent-style=\"width: 384px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240722165811-snh5t4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722165811-snh5t4x","updated":"20240722165811"}},{"ID":"20240722161806-vyylh6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722161806-vyylh6s","updated":"20240722161811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"红芪、黄芪对比"}]},{"ID":"20240722161811-v4kd5ax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722161811-v4kd5ax","updated":"20240722161812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"红芪黄芪对比"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/红芪黄芪对比-20240722161812-cf3b029.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240722161814-pzj78ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240722161814-pzj78ot","updated":"20240806160127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：红芪的茎杆是红色的，生长要比黄芪缓慢许多，且红芪的根部是深红或者暗红色，比较偏黑一点。黄芪的根部采挖出来是土灰色或者灰白色的；据说红芪有跟黄芪一样的效果，更优于黄芪，但因为分布较少所以无法大量应用；点我跳转→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20240506114745-6o7wf4i","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"058黄耆（黄芪）"}]},{"ID":"20240722161816-d4ihip0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240722161816-d4ihip0"}},{"ID":"20240902145301-qyqpwoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-qyqpwoc","updated":"20240902145308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：红芪"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-q16gxph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-q16gxph","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红芪《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-hismzkv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-hismzkv","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HónɡQí"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-c6llcb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-c6llcb9","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RADIXHEDYSARI"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-l2x0ef6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-l2x0ef6","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】岩黄芪、黑芪"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-8h293dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-8h293dw","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为豆科植物多序岩黄芪HedysarumpolybotrysHand.-Mazz.的干燥根。秋季挖根，堆起发热，以使糖化，然后去掉茎基须根，晒至柔软，手搓再晒，直至全干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-roqztsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-roqztsk","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈圆柱形，少有分枝，上端略粗，长10～50cm，直径0.6～2cm。表面灰红棕色，有纵皱纹、横长皮孔及少数支根痕，外皮易脱落，剥落处淡黄色。质硬而韧，不易折断，断面纤维性，并显粉性，皮部黄白色，木部淡黄棕色，射线放射状，形成层环浅棕色。气微，味微甜，嚼之有豆腥味。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-jz23edq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-jz23edq","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-59sqrky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-59sqrky","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品横切面：木栓层为6～8列木栓细胞。皮层狭窄，外侧有2～4列厚角细胞。韧皮部较宽，外侧有裂隙，纤维成束散在，纤维壁厚，微木化；韧皮射线外侧常弯曲。形成层成环。木质部导管单个散在或2～3个相聚，其周围有木纤维。纤维束周围的薄壁细胞含草酸钙方晶。粉末黄棕色。纤维成束，直径5～22μm，壁厚，微木化，周围细胞含草酸钙方晶，形成晶纤维，含晶细胞壁不均匀增厚。草酸钙方晶直径7～14μm，长约至22μm。具缘纹孔导管直径至145μm。淀粉粒单粒类圆形或卵圆形，直径2～19μm；复粒由2～8分粒组成。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-mwwoaw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-mwwoaw8","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末5g，置索氏提取器中，加石油醚（60～90℃）80ml，加热回流4小时，提取液移置分液漏斗中，用1％碳酸钾溶液振摇提取3次（20ml、20ml、10ml），合并碳酸钾液，用稀盐酸调节PH值至1～2，再用乙醚振摇提取3次，每次20ml,合并乙醚液，挥干，残渣加甲醇1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取红芪对照药材5g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验。吸取上述两种溶液各10μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以石油醚（30～60℃）-醋酸乙酯-苯（3：2：2）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以1％香草醛硫酸溶液。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的桃红色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-69q9tmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-69q9tmz","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，大小分开，洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-e9sj6d4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-e9sj6d4","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-leiw10n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-leiw10n","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-4oi163n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-4oi163n","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】补气固表，利尿托毒，排脓，敛疮生肌。用于气虚乏力，食少便溏，中气下陷，久泻脱肛，便血崩漏，表虚自汗，气虚水肿，痈疽难溃，血虚萎黄，内热消渴，慢性肾炎蛋白尿，糖尿病。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-gjw3ht0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-gjw3ht0","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～30g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-criv6rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-criv6rk","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处，防潮，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-cd6axsm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-cd6axsm","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）同属植物中下列4种植物的根在不同地区有代红芪入药者：紫花岩黄芪HedysarumaustrosibiricumB.Fedtsch；川西岩黄芪HedysarumlimprichtiiUlbr.；太白岩黄芪HedysarumviciodesTurcz.vartaipeicum（Hand.-Mazz.）Liu；锡金岩黄芪HedysarumsikkimenseBenth.。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-4kquo1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-4kquo1g","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-gcftpox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-gcftpox","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"红芪《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-6ea5bne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-6ea5bne","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HónɡQí"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-oy4mqxb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-oy4mqxb","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】manyinflorescanedsweetvetchroot"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-i5t0mdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-i5t0mdx","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】纳洼善马、真盘子、岩黄芪、黑芪。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-3q8b60i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-3q8b60i","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-2t1rqpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-2t1rqpk","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为豆科植物多序岩黄芪的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-6y09s4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-6y09s4r","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：HedysarumpolybotrysHand.Mazz."}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-y18a1km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-y18a1km","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季采挖，洗净，切去根头部及支根，晒干后打捆。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-782pm3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-782pm3w","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多序岩黄芪多年生草本，高达1.5cm。主根粗长，圆柱形，外皮红棕色长10-50cm。叶互生；叶柄长；托叶披针形，基部边合；奇数羽状复叶，长达15cm；小叶7-25，叶柄基部甚短；叶片长圆状卵形，长1-3.5cm，宽5-11mm，先端近平截或微凹，基部宽楔形，全缘，上面无毛，下面中脉被长柔毛。总状花序腋生，长5-8cm，有花20-25，花梗丝状，长2-3mm，被长柔毛；花萼斜钟形，被短毛，最下1个颧齿较其余4齿长大；蝶形花冠，淡黄色，长约1cm；雄蕊10，9合1离，子房狭长形，具柄。荚果扁平，串球状，有3-5节，边缘具窄翅，表面有稀疏网纹及短柔毛，每节有椭圆形种子1颗。花期6-8月，果期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-4p2vct9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-4p2vct9","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-7lqdbdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-7lqdbdm","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔2600m以下的山坡石缝或灌木丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-g9mr2ks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-g9mr2ks","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于内蒙古、宁夏、甘肃及四川西部。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-tvjmyrq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-tvjmyrq","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-rhanb1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-rhanb1l","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别根圆柱形，少分枝，长10-50cm，直径0.8-2cm。表面灰红棕色，具纵皱纹，有少数支根痕，皮孔横长，色稍浅，略凸起。栓皮易脱落，露出淡黄色皮部及纤维。质坚硬，难折断，断面纤维性，色浅，富粉性。横断面皮部淡棕色，约占半径的1/2-1/3；形成层环形，棕色，木部致密。气微而特异，味微甜。以粉质多、味甘者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-wryofq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-wryofq0","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别根横切面：木栓层为数列切向延长的木栓细胞。栓内层2-4列，为厚角细胞。韧皮部纤维成束散在纤维束周围薄壁细胞含草酸钙方晶，长14-22μm，直径7-14μm。韧皮射线常波形弯曲。形成层成环。木质部导管直径12-110μm，木纤维众多，位于导管周围，基周围薄壁细胞中亦含草酸钙方晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-64twh3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-64twh3l","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：黄棕色。①纤维及晶纤维多，纤维壁微木化，表面有纵裂纹，初生壁与次生壁界限明显，孔沟不明显，胞腔线形，或不明显；晶纤维的含晶细胞壁常不均匀增厚，方晶大多横长排列。②草酸钙方晶双锥形、长方形或类方形，长约至22μm，直径7-14μm。③淀粉粒单粒类圆形或卵圆形，直径2-19μm，脐点裂缝状、点状、人字状或三叉状，层纹不明显；复粒由2-6（-8）分粒组成。④导管大，直径到145μm，多破碎，主为具缘纹孔导管。另外可见木栓细胞，棕色块。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-wgqw2e6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-wgqw2e6","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】根含红芪多糖（HPS），微量元素（硒等），并含γ-氨基丁酸（γ-diaminobutyricacid），（-）-1，3-二羟基-9-甲氧基紫檀烷（1，3-hydroxy-9-methoxypterocarpane），5-羟基-2-（2-羟基-4-甲氧苯基）-6-甲氧基苯并呋喃[5-hydroxy-2-（2-hydroxy-4-methoxyphenyl）-6-methoxybenzofuran）]，刺芒柄花素（formononetin），阿魏酸烷（基）酯（alkylferulate），阿佛洛莫生（afromosin），甘草甙元（liquiritigenin），异甙草甙元（isoliquiritigenin），（-）-驴食草酚[（-）-vestitol]，3＇，7-二羟基-4＇-3＇，7-dihydroxy-4＇-methoxy-isoflavone），香草酸（vanillicacid），3，4，5-三甲氧基肉桂酸甲基酯（3，4，5-trimethoxycinnamicacidmethylester），6-羟基-2（2-羟基-4-甲氧苯基）-苯并呋喃[6-hydroxy-2-（2-hydroxy-4-methoxyphenyl）-benzofuran]，芒柄花甙（ononin），琥珀酸（succinicacid），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），4-甲氧基苯乙酸甲酯（benzeneaceticacid-4-methoxy-methylester），2，6-双叔丁基-4-甲基苯酚[2，6-bis（1，1-dimethylethyl）-4-methylphenol]，正十五烷酸甲酯（n-penta-decanoicacidmethylester），棕榈酸甲酯（palmiticacidmethylester），9，11-十八碳二烯酸甲酯（9，11-octadecadienoicacidmethylester），亚麻酸甲酯（linolenicacidmethylester），硬脂酸甲酯（stearicmethylester），山yu酸甲酯（behenicacidmethylester），1，7-二羟基-3，8-二甲氧基氧（口占）吨酮（1，7-dihydroxy-3，8-dimethoxyxanthone），二十四烷酸（tetracosanoicacid），硬脂酸（stearicacid），3＇，4＇同一羟基黄酮（3＇，4＇，3，5，7-pentahydroxyflavone），熊果酸（ursolicacid），阿魏酸二十四醇酯（lignocerylferulate），3，4，5-三甲氧基桂皮酸甲酯（methyl-3,4,5-trimethoxy-cinnamate）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-b23r31t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-b23r31t","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取本品粉末3g，加水30ml，加0.2%三酮溶液2滴，至沸水浴中加热5min，冷后呈紫红色。（检查氨基酸、多肽）（2）薄层色谱取本品粉末3g，加水15ml冷浸过夜，滤过，作供试品溶液。另取精氨酸、脯氨酸、苏氨酸，以乙醇溶解成每ml含1mg的对照溶液。取上述两种溶液点于同一硅酸G薄层板上，以乙醇-氨水-水（7：1：2）展开，展距20cm，取出晾干，喷雾吲哚醌试剂，105℃烘烤数分钟，供试品色谱中在与对照品色谱相应的位置上显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-liu885f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-liu885f","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】红芪除去杂质，大小分开，洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-p0ndgf6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-p0ndgf6","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；温"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-a2e3isr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-a2e3isr","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-g688eyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-g688eyc","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】固表止汗；补气利尿；托毒敛疮。主气虚乏力；食少便溏；久泻脱肛；便血；崩漏；表虚自汗；气虚浮肿；血虚萎黄；痈疽难溃难敛"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-w432wxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-w432wxa","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-30g。益气补中蜜炙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-lqjo81n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-lqjo81n","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】用于气虚乏力，食少便塘，中气下陷，久泻脱肛，便血崩漏，表虚自汗，气虚水肿，痛疽难溃，血虚萎黄，内热消渴，慢性肾炎蛋白尿，糖尿病。"}]},{"ID":"20240902145301-undhp2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145301-undhp2h","updated":"20240902145312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902145302-kwhv4n8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902145302-kwhv4n8","updated":"20240902145312"}},{"ID":"20240902145304-kc2vq2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902145304-kc2vq2p","updated":"20240902145312"}}]}